   324	                # 06-views: a successor keeps the predecessor's direction; the writer stores a numeric ladder in that direction (the first
   325	                # real succession, 2027 hyperscaler capex after 2026, came low-to-high where its predecessor ran high-to-low), so no refusal here
   326	        if outcome in ('new', 'succession'):
   327	            object_id = universe.resolve(c['object'])
